tt-local-generator (0.64.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * fix(gallery): gallery cards no longer overflow their cell on hover. Root
    cause: the card's media/card zones (gallery_layout.pin_fixed_zone) pinned
    only their MEASURED size via an overlay-anchor, but never clipped paint —
    GtkOverlay's per-child clip defaults False and no Gtk.Overflow.HIDDEN was
    set anywhere. So a hover-swapped Gtk.Video (which carries only a size-request
    FLOOR, no content-fit ceiling, and reports the media's full resolution)
    painted past the pinned zone and spilled over neighbouring cards; the action
    bar could too. Fixed at the source: pin_fixed_zone now sets
    set_overflow(HIDDEN) + set_clip_overlay on the pinned child, and both the
    native GenerationCard and the artgen card clip themselves to their bounds
    (respecting the rounded border). Covers video/image/animate AND artgen grids.

